    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;Spy 1 Lovecraftian&quot; an enthralling visual novel that combines the charm of a funny teen romance with the spine-tingling mysteries of the Lovecraftian world. Immerse yourself in a captivating narrative where ordinary high school life collides with the extraordinary, and where love finds a way even in the darkest of corners.<br>This visual novel has an average length of 5~8 hours.  Word count: 75000 words.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/8e85037c0658ba91098fb277d662e114.poster.avif?t=1727501215\" width=720 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/8e85037c0658ba91098fb277d662e114.webm?t=1727501215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/8e85037c0658ba91098fb277d662e114.mp4?t=1727501215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Hilarious Teen Romance:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/3c6eb3762dd268e21ac756fd62772846.avif?t=1727501215\" width=720 height=196 /></span><br>Meet Billy Hayward, a regular high school student who suddenly has a cute girlfriend. Experience the ups and downs of high school romance, from awkward crushes to a pressured family dinner with your girlfriend's parents, as you strive to win the heart of your dream girl. The witty dialogues and interesting characters will keep you laughing and invested in your quest for love.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Thrilling Story:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/b89270a17ea04c13f23b13c34885eed5.avif?t=1727501215\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br>&quot;Spy 1 Lovecraftian&quot; weaves a gripping narrative that blurs the lines between reality and nightmare. As you uncover the mysteries of Lovecraftian horrors lurking beneath the surface of a seemingly ordinary island city.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cute Girlfriend for the Main Character:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/c8665b9ebf6e2e3b4497a9b4a204f789.avif?t=1727501215\" width=720 height=196 /></span><br>In the midst of chaos and cosmic horrors, a silver lining emerges in the form of Alice Tenderwood, the adorable and supportive girlfriend of the main character. Her presence provides a sense of warmth and stability amidst the chaos. As you progress through the story, you'll witness their relationship grow, adding an endearing dimension to the narrative.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dangerous girlfriend's parents:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/e3ac0b93b17bf8a519464ddd4b059f0f.avif?t=1727501215\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820030/extras/626d976c166d25d7bb3137a1d4cf8e9d.avif?t=1727501215\" width=600 height=164 /></span><br>Your girlfriend parents lead double lives as a lethal assassin and a high-tech spy. As you navigate the complexities of your relationship, you'll find yourself entangled in a dangerous web of secrets, action. Can you handle the pressure and keep your love alive amidst the perilous secrets her family guards? Prepare for heart-pounding choices and a love story like no other in a game where love and danger are two sides of the same thrilling coin.",
